       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SWI98400.
      ******************************************************************
      *     PROGRAMA SWI98400.                                    *
      *                                                                *
      *     Lista de Extractos do BdM
      ******************************************************************
      *     LOG ALTERACOES:                                            *
      *   USER     / DATA     /   REFERENCIA / OBSERVACOES             *
      *                                                                *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       DATA DIVISION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
           'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE SWI98400         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            DECLARACOES DE DB2
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD7401 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            MENSAGEM DE INPUT E  OUTPUT
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY SWCV9840.
       COPY SWCV9841.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0015.
       COPY VIAW0005.
       COPY VIAK0001.
       COPY VIAK0002.
       COPY SWCK0001.
       COPY SWCK0002.
      *
       COPY ARCL0039.
       COPY ETCL0002.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            SWITCH
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  SW-SWITCH.
           05 FILLER                     PIC X(01) VALUE SPACES.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            CONSTANTES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-SWVT7401 PIC X(08) VALUE 'SWVT7401'.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *           VARIAVEIS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-VARIAVEIS.
           05 WS-DDATAUPL                  PIC  X(10)  VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-CPROCESS-MIN              PIC  X(01)  VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-CPROCESS-MAX              PIC  X(01)  VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-CFILEXTR                  PIC  X(100) VALUE SPACES.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            PROGRAM CONTROL
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME     PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWI98400'.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *              DECLARACOES DE CURSORES DB2                     *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *
       01  WS-CURSOR-VARS.
           05 FILLER                     PIC X(01) VALUE SPACES.
           EXEC SQL
              DECLARE CURSWT01 CURSOR FOR
                 SELECT DDATAUPL
                      , ZSEQFILE
                      , CFILEXTR
                      , CLIBRNAM
                      , CFILENAM
                      , CPROCESS
                      , GDESCERR
                      , CUSERIDC
                      , HTIMESTC
                      , CUSERID
                      , HTIMEST
                   FROM SWVT7401
                  WHERE DDATAUPL  >= :WS-DDATAUPL
                    AND CFILEXTR  LIKE :WS-CFILEXTR
                    AND CPROCESS  BETWEEN :WS-CPROCESS-MIN
                                      AND :WS-CPROCESS-MAX
                    AND (
                              DDATAUPL  >  :SWCD7401-DDATAUPL
                          OR  DDATAUPL  =  :SWCD7401-DDATAUPL
                          AND ZSEQFILE  >= :SWCD7401-ZSEQFILE
                    )
                  ORDER
                     BY DDATAUPL
                      , ZSEQFILE
           END-EXEC.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                        PIC X(40) VALUE
           'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE SWI98400         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       LINKAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *
       COPY VIAL0004.
      *
            EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0009 END-EXEC.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            0000-MAINLINE
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       0000-MAINLINE.
      *
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
              THRU 2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
      *
       0099-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           COPY VIAP0004.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-INPUT    TO SWCV9840-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV9840-ASE               TO SWCV9841-ASE.
      *
           MOVE ZEROES                     TO SWCV9841-INDICE.
           PERFORM 1100-LIMPA-OCCURS
              THRU 1199-LIMPA-OCCURS-EXIT
             UNTIL SWCV9841-PAGINA-CHEIA.
      *
       1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1100-LIMPA-OCCURS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       1100-LIMPA-OCCURS.
      *
           ADD 1                       TO SWCV9841-INDICE.
           MOVE VIAK0002-DATA-MINIMA
             TO SWCV9841-D-DDATAUPL(SWCV9841-INDICE)
           MOVE ZEROES
             TO SWCV9841-D-ZSEQFILE(SWCV9841-INDICE)
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV9841-D-CFILEXTR(SWCV9841-INDICE)
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV9841-D-CUSERIDC(SWCV9841-INDICE)
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV9841-D-HTIMESTC(SWCV9841-INDICE)
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV9841-D-CPROCESS(SWCV9841-INDICE)
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV9841-D-GDESCERR(SWCV9841-INDICE)
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV9841-D-HTIMEST(SWCV9841-INDICE)
      *
           .
       1199-LIMPA-OCCURS-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE SWCV9840-NOMEFXLS          TO SWCV9841-NOMEFXLS.
           MOVE SWCV9840-NMAXLIST          TO SWCV9841-NMAXLIST.
           MOVE SWCV9840-DDATAUPL-PAG      TO SWCV9841-DDATAUPL-PAG.
           MOVE SWCV9840-ZSEQFILE-PAG      TO SWCV9841-ZSEQFILE-PAG.
           MOVE SWCV9840-DDATAUPL          TO SWCV9841-DDATAUPL.
           MOVE SWCV9840-CFILEXTR          TO SWCV9841-CFILEXTR.
           MOVE SWCV9840-CPROCESS          TO SWCV9841-CPROCESS.
      *
           PERFORM 2010-VALIDACOES
              THRU 2019-VALIDACOES-EXIT.
      *
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2020-OPEN
                 THRU 2029-OPEN-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2030-FETCH
                 THRU 2039-FETCH-EXIT

DEBUG         MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA FU'   TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
DEBUG         MOVE 'SWCV9841-INDICE-INVERSO' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM (1)
DEBUG         MOVE  SWCV9841-INDICE-INVERSO  TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(1)
DEBUG         MOVE 'SWCV9841-LENGTH-OCCUR'   TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM (2)
DEBUG         MOVE  SWCV9841-LENGTH-OCCUR    TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(2)
DEBUG         MOVE 'SWCV9841-LENGTH'         TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM (3)
DEBUG         MOVE  SWCV9841-LENGTH          TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(3)
DEBUG         MOVE 'SWCV9841-DIMINUI-LENGTH' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM (4)
DEBUG         MOVE  SWCV9841-DIMINUI-LENGTH  TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(4)
DEBUG         PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
DEBUG            THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT

              IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
                 IF DB2-OK
                    PERFORM 2040-CONTINUA
                       THRU 2049-CONTINUA-EXIT
                 ELSE
                    COMPUTE SWCV9841-DIMINUI-LENGTH EQUAL
                         SWCV9841-INDICE-INVERSO * SWCV9841-LENGTH-OCCUR
                    COMPUTE SWCV9841-LENGTH EQUAL SWCV9841-LENGTH
                         - SWCV9841-DIMINUI-LENGTH
                    MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                                           TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                 END-IF
              END-IF
              PERFORM 2070-CLOSE
                 THRU 2079-CLOSE-EXIT
           END-IF.


       2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.


      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2010-VALIDACOES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2010-VALIDACOES.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2010-VALIDACOES' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE SWCV9840-DDATAUPL          TO WS-DDATAUPL.
      *
           MOVE 'A'                        TO WS-CPROCESS-MIN.
           MOVE 'Z'                        TO WS-CPROCESS-MAX.
           IF SWCV9840-CPROCESS NOT EQUAL SPACES
              MOVE SWCV9840-CPROCESS       TO WS-CPROCESS-MIN
                                              WS-CPROCESS-MAX
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE ALL '%'                    TO WS-CFILEXTR.
           IF SWCV9840-CFILEXTR NOT EQUAL SPACES
              STRING '%' FUNCTION TRIM( SWCV9840-CFILEXTR ) '%'
                                           DELIMITED BY SIZE
                                         INTO WS-CFILEXTR
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE SWCV9840-DDATAUPL-PAG      TO SWCD7401-DDATAUPL.
           MOVE SWCV9840-ZSEQFILE-PAG      TO SWCD7401-ZSEQFILE.
      *
       2019-VALIDACOES-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2020-OPEN
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2020-OPEN.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2020-OPEN' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EXEC SQL
              OPEN CURSWT01
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT7401               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

       2029-OPEN-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2030-FETCH
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2030-FETCH.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2030-FETCH' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EXEC SQL
              FETCH CURSWT01
               INTO
                    :SWCD7401-DDATAUPL
                  , :SWCD7401-ZSEQFILE
                  , :SWCD7401-CFILEXTR
                  , :SWCD7401-CLIBRNAM
                  , :SWCD7401-CFILENAM
                  , :SWCD7401-CPROCESS
                  , :SWCD7401-GDESCERR
                  , :SWCD7401-CUSERIDC
                  , :SWCD7401-HTIMESTC
                  , :SWCD7401-CUSERID
                  , :SWCD7401-HTIMEST
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT7401               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

       2039-FETCH-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                       2040-CONTINUA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2040-CONTINUA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2040-CONTINUA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE ZEROES                     TO SWCV9841-INDICE.
           PERFORM 2050-TRATA-OCCURS
              THRU 2059-TRATA-OCCURS-EXIT
             UNTIL DB2-NOTFND
                OR SWCV9841-PAGINA-CHEIA
                OR NOT VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF NOT SWCV9841-PAGINA-CHEIA
                    COMPUTE SWCV9841-INDICE-INVERSO EQUAL
                         SWCV9841-INDICE-INVERSO - SWCV9841-INDICE
                    COMPUTE SWCV9841-DIMINUI-LENGTH EQUAL
                         SWCV9841-INDICE-INVERSO * SWCV9841-LENGTH-OCCUR
                    COMPUTE SWCV9841-LENGTH EQUAL SWCV9841-LENGTH -
                         SWCV9841-DIMINUI-LENGTH
                    SET  VIAL0002-FIM-CONSULTA TO TRUE
              END-IF
              IF DB2-NOTFND
                    SET  VIAL0002-FIM-CONSULTA TO TRUE
              END-IF
           END-IF.

       2049-CONTINUA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2050-TRATA-OCCURS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2050-TRATA-OCCURS.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2050-TRATA-OCCURS' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           ADD 1                       TO SWCV9841-INDICE.
           MOVE SWCD7401-DDATAUPL
             TO SWCV9841-D-DDATAUPL(SWCV9841-INDICE).
           MOVE SWCD7401-ZSEQFILE
             TO SWCV9841-D-ZSEQFILE(SWCV9841-INDICE).
           MOVE SWCD7401-CFILEXTR
             TO SWCV9841-D-CFILEXTR(SWCV9841-INDICE).
           MOVE SWCD7401-CPROCESS
             TO SWCV9841-D-CPROCESS(SWCV9841-INDICE).
           MOVE SWCD7401-GDESCERR
             TO SWCV9841-D-GDESCERR(SWCV9841-INDICE).
           MOVE SWCD7401-CUSERIDC
             TO SWCV9841-D-CUSERIDC(SWCV9841-INDICE).
           MOVE SWCD7401-HTIMESTC
             TO SWCV9841-D-HTIMESTC(SWCV9841-INDICE).
           MOVE SWCD7401-HTIMEST
             TO SWCV9841-D-HTIMEST(SWCV9841-INDICE).
      *
           PERFORM 2030-FETCH
              THRU 2039-FETCH-EXIT.
      *
       2059-TRATA-OCCURS-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2070-CLOSE
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2070-CLOSE.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2070-CLOSE' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EXEC SQL
              CLOSE CURSWT01
           END-EXEC.

       2079-CLOSE-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF SWCV9840-NMAXLIST EQUAL ZEROES
              MOVE VIAL0001-CAPLIC         TO ARCL0039-CAPLIC
              MOVE VIAL0001-COPCAO         TO ARCL0039-COPCAO
              PERFORM ARCR0039-NMAXLIST
                 THRU ARCR0039-NMAXLIST-EXIT

              IF ETCL0002-ABEND-DB2
                 MOVE ETCL0002-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME
                 MOVE ETCL0002-SQLCA       TO VIAL0002-SQLCA
              END-IF

              MOVE ARCL0039-NMAXLIST       TO SWCV9841-NMAXLIST
           ELSE
              MOVE SWCV9840-NMAXLIST       TO SWCV9841-NMAXLIST
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV9841-MSG               TO VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-OUTPUT.
           MOVE SWCV9841-LENGTH            TO VIAL0001-LENGTH-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV9841-NR-CAMPOS         TO VIAL0001-NR-CAMPOS.
           MOVE SWCV9841-INDICE            TO VIAL0001-OCORRENCIAS.

       3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0003 END-EXEC.
      *==============================================================
           COPY VIAP0015.
           COPY ARCR0039.

